Z||000008||Sleeper||04-22-2001||06:51 PM||||May<BR> <BR>12th - Loren Frease's Wild Ride  -Loren Freeze will be leading us into the back roads of Orange County where we will be putting our Fiero's and driving skills to the test - Radar detectors are optional. The meeting point will be at 1st meeting stop will be at "Johns Place" Take Freeway<BR>55 No./So. To Chapman Ave., in Orange, go east (left so., right no.) continue on Chapman to Shopping Center Road (Jamboree & Chapman), turn right into shopping center. <BR>     <BR>   Restaurant has Hamburgers, Eggs and Salad Bar. Opens at 7AM.  We will leave 9AM sharp.  If you are going to eat breakfast give yourself plenty of time to arrive before 9 AM. For further information E-mail Loren Frease at mymera87@earthlink.net.<BR> <BR>or check out upcoming events at<BR> <A HREF="http://clubs.hemmings.com/fieroswest/" TARGET=_blank>http://clubs.hemmings.com/fieroswest/</A> ||||reg||1
